{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S09把人物想回去的动机进一步解释成怕孤单、甚至愿意再受那些气，较Y原本保留的两种可能性更武断，削弱了一点心理的开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词加亮让普通观众能迅速抓住每段叙事的转折，而感受文字与话语交替、并按音乐时点出现，使观众更容易边听边理解情绪如何变化。它不仅交代了人物为什么舍不得、为什么不愿回头，也用具体的声音、动作、呼吸和身体感受，把怀念、抗拒、孤独、动摇到逐渐接受的过程连成一条线。Y的叙事本身也清楚，但右侧大量短词同时呈现，容易让人看到许多情绪标签，却不容易判断它们在音乐和人物心理发展中的先后关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7e1bb6a6-af4a-45d4-9272-e04fbe5be01b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T063037846364Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:31:29.578525+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9da8ddc760114f7deb60322c5d37db52e396770e2e268411a7661a0c03690e0e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"